yle="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Fair Value or</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Total Compensation</strong></p></td><td><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 1px solid;vertical-align:bottom;" colspan="2"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Total </strong><strong>Average</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Equity </strong><strong>Award</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>Adjustments</strong></p></td><td><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#cceeff"><td style="width:10%;vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">2025</p></td><td style="width:1%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;vertical-align:bottom;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">$</p></td><td style="width:10%;vertical-align:bottom;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:right;">439,801</p></td><td style="width:1%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;vertical-align:bottom;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">$</p></td><td style="width:10%;vertical-align:bottom;"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:right;">(86,431)</p><